          "Keep the sample small enough to finish and large enough to expose a repeated gap. Use the correction log to estimate rework, and separate corrections caused by source errors from those caused by judgment. Review the action after two cycles and report what moved, what did not, and what remains unknown. Choose the sample from the queue export before the meeting so the discussion cannot drift to memorable cases. The October 28 evidence trail for quality review should show the source version and the client sponsor decision."
