          "Pick the sample from the timekeeping system, not from the cases the team remembers, so the review is not biased toward easy work. Review the exception mix each month; a rising missing-evidence count may be an intake problem rather than an operator problem. Escalate a repeated high-risk client intake gap to outsourcing company operators with the case evidence, not only a summary count. Keep a short action log with the decision, the owner, the due date, and the next sample that will test it. At Outsourced Company, record the October 28 client intake correction and link it to the original source."
