          "If the queue cannot be reconciled in the morning, record the gap and assign an owner before starting new task queue work. When the next step belongs to team lead, write the request and the due time instead of leaving the case in a waiting state. Before the shift ends, reconcile the task queue queue and write a carryover note for every item that is still open. At the end of the day, compare the open queue with the morning list and explain every unexplained difference. The October 28 evidence trail for task queue should show the source version and the team lead decision."
