          "Pick the sample from the reporting dashboard, not from the cases the team remembers, so the review is not biased toward easy work. Do not publish a quality score without the sample size and the exclusions that produced it. Escalate a repeated high-risk task queue gap to outsourcing company operators with the case evidence, not only a summary count. Keep a short action log with the decision, the owner, the due date, and the next sample that will test it. For the October 28 sample, Outsourced Company should include one task queue case that crossed owners."
